"In mortal life Nous was a hermit rune mage in Emeric's band."
"Nous sacrificed himself to give humanity choice."
"Nous speaks through the interface with a dry, mocking wit."
"Nous named Viviane Anarchist, then Vandal, for breaking his anchors."
"Nous complains that outlanders grow more obnoxious every century."
"Nous calls the Academy obelisk an anchor for something vast."
"Nous had one trump of causality; he spent it to shatter Oleander's shield."
"Nous urged Viviane to kill Semeryss, who had been hidden from his sight."
"Being dead makes gods very bored, says Nous."
"Nous says stat gains come from Nyil and one's own efforts."
"Nous welcomed Viviane's ascension."
